 "remarks": "The Landings is a lovely waterfront condo complex on the Norwalk River. There are 17 units which rarely come on the market. This is on the first floor near the lobby so it is very easy living. Living room with fireplace, two bedroom with two full baths and one half bath. Hardwood floor in the living/dining room and kitchen, and carpet in the bedrooms. A wonderful terrace overlooking the Norwalk River where you will enjoy beautiful sunsets, birds, and boats. Parking garage is under the building with an assigned spot, storage, and elevator. An assessment will be forthcoming March 2025 for outside painting.",
